{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>Arise and thresh, O daughter of Zion</b> — \"Arise; I will set your horn as iron\" — by way of parable, for the nations are like grain on the threshing floor." "<b>their wealth</b> — Like בצע. The meaning is like their wealth, for it is a doubling of the word."], :book :micah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Micah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=20&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:13:53.817047918Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}